  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The rear window to the proposed ground floor rear extension serving a kitchen, by reason of its use, siting and proximity to the boundary shared with No. 15 Stafford Road, would result in an unacceptable level of actual and perceived overlooking to No. 15. The proposal would therefore be detrimental to the residential amenities of the neighbouring occupiers at No. 15 Stafford Road, contrary to&amp;nbsp;Policy D3.D(7) of the London Plan (2021), Policy DM1 of the Development Management Policies Local Plan document (2013), emerging policy GR1 of the Harrow Local Plan 2021 TO 2041 and the relevant provisions of the adopted Harrow Supplementary Planning Document Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, system-ui, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, sans-serif; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
